<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia MBf Capital 1996 net up 27 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia MBf Capital 1996 net up 27 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)	43.3    vs	  34.2</p>
<p>    Net profit		 337.58   vs	 265.98</p>
<p>    Turnover		 1,975.77   vs     1,416.05</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   500.60   vs	 380.12</p>
<p>    Minorities	  less   1.81   vs   less  2.17</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries   less  38.05   vs   add  44.90</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 5.0    vs	   5.0</p>
<p>NOTE - MBf Capital Bhd is a financial services group with units in consumer finance, stockbroking, credit cards, unit trust management, leasing and factoring and insurance.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
